## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Telnyx Side:**
```
SIP Connection: Livekit Dashboard SIP Trunk
Anchorsite: [Your nearest region]

Authentication & Routing:
  → Primary FQDN: YourFQDNforLivekit.com:5060
  → Port: 5060
  → SIP Subdomain: dashboard.sip.telnyx.com

Inbound Settings:
  → Number Format: E.164
  → Transport: UDP
  → Codecs: G711U, G711A, Opus only

Outbound Profile:
  → Localization: [Your country]
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Telnyx Inbound
  → Numbers: [Your Telnyx number]
  → Allowed Addresses: sip.telnyx.com (or Telnyx IPs)
  → Auth: [Telnyx SIP credentials from Step 4]

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Telnyx Inbound trunk
  → Type: Direct/Individual/Multi-Line (your choice)
  → Agent: [Your agent name]
```

